.TH WALLPAPERCTL 1 "2026-07-27" "wallpaperctl" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wallpaperctl \- select and control the Mango wallpaper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wallpaperctl
.B status
.br
.B wallpaperctl
.B apply-current
.br
.B wallpaperctl
.B apply
.I path
.br
.B wallpaperctl
.B pick
.br
.B wallpaperctl
.B next
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wallpaperctl
keeps the selected wallpaper in the Mango state directory and controls a background
.B swaybg
process. Wallpaper images are discovered from
.I ~/assets
and
.I ~/assets/wallpapers .
.PP
The
.B status
command emits Waybar-compatible JSON.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Print the current wallpaper as Waybar JSON.
.TP
.B apply-current
Apply the saved wallpaper, or the default image if one exists.
.TP
.BI apply " PATH"
Apply a specific image file.
.TP
.B pick
Choose an image with rofi.
.TP
.B next
Apply the next discovered image in sorted order.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/mango/wallpaper
Saved wallpaper path.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/mango/swaybg.log
.B swaybg
output log.
.TP
.I ~/assets/empoleon.png
Default wallpaper when present.
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.B swaybg
is required to display images. The
.B pick
command also requires
.BR rofi .
The optional notification uses
.BR notify-send .
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wallpaperctl status
wallpaperctl apply ~/assets/wallpapers/night.png
wallpaperctl next
wallpaperctl pick
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The requested action completed successfully or no optional action was needed.
.TP
.B 1
A required dependency or image was unavailable.
.TP
.B 2
An unknown command was supplied.
